{"hymn":"S132","parent":"E169","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Señor eres precioso","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su dulzura","syl":{"n1":["Se","i"],"n2":["ñor","t"],"n3":["e","i"],"n4":["res","t"],"n5":["pre","i"],"n6":["cio","m"],"n7":["so,","t"],"n8":"Muy","n9":["be","i"],"n10":["llo","t"],"n11":["pa","i"],"n12":["ra","t"],"n13":"Dios;","n14":["Un","i"],"n15":["gi","m"],"n16":["do","t"],"n17":"con","n18":["a","i"],"n19":["cei","m"],"n20":["te,","t"],"n21":"Su","n22":["go","i"],"n23":["zo,","t"],"n24":["Su‿e","i"],"n26":["lec","m"],"n28":["ción.","t"],"n29":["Se","i"],"n30":["ñor","t"],"n31":["cuán","i"],"n32":["to‿a","m"],"n33":["pre","m"],"n34":["cia","m"],"n35":["mos","t"],"n36":"Hoy","n37":"Tu","n38":["her","i"],"n39":["mo","m"],"n40":["sa","t"],"n41":"faz,","n42":["Fra","i"],"n44":["gan","m"],"n45":["cia","t"],"n46":"y","n47":["dul","i"],"n48":["zu","m"],"n49":["ra","t"],"n50":"Con","n51":["gra","i"],"n52":["cia","t"],"n53":"sin","n54":["i","i"],"n55":["gual.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Eres lo más hermoso","Y bello, mi Señor;","Tus labios vierten gracia;","Conmueves nuestro‿amor."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Los magos te‿ofrecieron","Tesoros al nacer;","Te sepultó un noble;","¡Qué hermosa muerte fue!"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Fue‿ungida Tu cabeza;","¡Cuán atractivo, Tú!","También Tus pies ungidos","Irradian Tu virtud."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Tu muerte‿es como mirra,","Consuelo‿al hombre trae;","Y Tu resurrección hoy","A Dios fragancia da."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Como la flor de‿alheña,","Hermoso es Tu ser;","Como‿el manzano‿en cierne,","Tu fruto dulce es."]},{"label":"7.","lines":["Mejor que‿el dulce vino,","Tu‿amor es para mí;","Tu nombre‿es como‿ungüento,","Y Tú‿el banquete‿aquí."]},{"label":"8.","lines":["Señor, al contemplarte","Y Tu belleza ver,","Probamos Tu dulzura","Gustando de Tu ser."]}]}